<section id="threading">
  <h2>Threading model</h2>
  <p>Capture and analysis are decoupled so the camera never blocks on inference:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>StreamReader</strong> (thread) reads frames from the source.</li>
    <li><strong>FrameBuffer</strong> holds a bounded, drop-oldest queue so slow analysis cannot stall capture.</li>
    <li><strong>AnalysisWorker</strong> (thread) runs the model pipeline and emits an <code>AnalysisResult</code>.</li>
    <li>Result and bus callbacks fire on the worker thread, then hop to the asyncio loop for fan-out.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted">This keeps the live feed smooth under load and lets heavy stages run at their own cadence.</p>
</section>
